&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of net new logo acquisition in multi-stakeholder, greenfield environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to prospect, break into new accounts, and build relationships with executive and technical buyers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep fluency in AI concepts, trends, and the enterprise AI landscape; able to credibly engage with data leaders and C-suite stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling into AI-native or AI-first companies, or into enterprises undergoing significant AI transformation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled in MEDDIC sales methodology and comfortable operating in ambiguity with limited playbook or precedent&lt;/li&gt;
